sequenceDiagram
  actor Customer
  participant UI as Browser/UI
  participant View as Django View
  participant Logic as Booking Model
  participant DB as Database
  Customer->>UI: Submit service, staff, date and time
  UI->>View: POST /book/
  View->>Logic: Validate form and construct appointment
  Logic->>DB: Query overlapping staff appointments
  alt Slot is available
    DB-->>Logic: No conflict
    Logic->>DB: Save confirmed appointment
    View-->>UI: Confirmation message
  else Slot conflicts
    DB-->>Logic: Existing overlap
    View-->>UI: Slot-taken validation error
  end
